        "original_id": "12301f65-16f3-565d-8865-b087c605cb89",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Zilpo Road, Morehead, Kentucky, Rowan County, Kentucky, United States\n- Roads: U.S. Highway 60, US 60, Interstate 64, Midland Trail\n- Topics: byway access, city location\n\nFacts:\n- Morehead is a home rule-class city in Rowan County, Kentucky, in the United States.\n- Morehead is located along US 60, which is the historic Midland Trail, and Interstate 64.\n- Zilpo Road is a nine-mile byway that starts south of Morehead, Kentucky.\n- Zilpo Road can be accessed by U.S. Highway 60.",
